                <h1 class="mb-4">About This Website</h1>

                <p class="fs-5">
                    <strong>CodeGround</strong> was created to help beginner Computer Science students 
                    learn to code — from complete scratch, no experience needed.
                </p>

                <p class="fs-5">
                    The focus is on two languages: <strong>Python</strong> and <strong>Java</strong>, 
                    taught through simple explanations, examples, and practice exercises rather than dense theory. 
                    Whether you're a first-year student, self-taught, or just curious about programming, 
                    this site is built to make coding feel approachable instead of overwhelming.
                </p>

                <p class="fs-5">
                    New lessons and resources are added regularly, with the goal of building a full 
                    beginner-friendly path from <em>"I've never coded before"</em> to 
                    <em>"I can build things."</em>
                </p>

